# No trailing slash: a git worktree usually gets its node_modules as a SYMLINK
# to the main checkout's, and `node_modules/` matches directories only — so the
# symlink was not ignored and `git add -A` committed it (once, for real).
node_modules
dist/
dist-gh/
coverage/
.vite.pid
*.log
.DS_Store
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Raw art inputs (decision A3: re-home, don't police). Concept references,
# pre-pack sprite sources and generator scratch live here and are NOT committed
# — only the PACKED atlases under public/assets/spritesheets/ are.
# scripts/pack-sprites.py and scripts/build_train_atlas.py read this tree; set
# IBK_ART_DIR to point them somewhere else.
#
# A3's TODO is discharged (2026-08-16): the ar015 16-direction loco batch and
# the 43 per-direction train refs both moved here, because the pass they were
# held for is retired — the side-scroller draws ONE heading (AR-036), and
# AR-031's 8-heading redraw is a RETIRED SPEC. `build_train_atlas.py` rebuilds
# public/.../train.png byte-identically from art/train-refs/ (verified by md5).
# A clone WITHOUT this tree still builds and runs the app; it just cannot
# regenerate the train atlas. History was deliberately not rewritten (A3).
/art/

